---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="404 - 页面未找到 | 隐形人网络技术博客"
  description="抱歉，您访问的页面不存在或已被移除。"
>
  <div class="min-h-[70vh] flex items-center justify-center px-4 text-center">
    <div class="space-y-6 max-w-md">
      <div class="text-7xl font-black text-[#905831]">
        404
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-[#1a1a1a]">页面穿梭失败</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-[#767676] leading-relaxed">
        您所寻找的技术指南或路由地址可能已被重命名、迁移或删除。
      </p>
      <div class="pt-4">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="px-6 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-[#0a0a0a] text-white text-xs font-bold hover:bg-[#905831] transition-colors inline-block shadow-sm hover:shadow"
        >
          返回博客首页
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
